<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets $300 mln three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets $300 mln three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Painewebber and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKERS TRUST NEW YORK CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    06.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.99     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.99</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
